AB  - In fair division applications, agents may have unequal entitlements reflecting their different contributions. Moreover, the contributions of agents may depend on the allocation itself. Previous fairness notions designed for agents with equal or pre-determined entitlements fail to characterize fairness in these collaborative allocation scenarios.
